  "excerpt": "A shrimp po-boy is a New Orleans sandwich of fried prawns in a soft French roll with shredded lettuce, tomato, and remoulade sauce. The shrimp are coated in seasoned cornmeal and flour and fried until crispy. The remoulade is a Creole sauce of mayonnaise, Dijon mustard, hot sauce, and capers.",
